{"id": "q0126", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1911101640, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Find the modulo $7$ remainder of the sum $1+3+5+7+9+\\dots+195+197+199.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0126.wav", "input_sha256": "777b2daabeec03c9bc1ff2e86551ca302bdd003f8b670f9976fc6392b1497e33", "input_samples": 146600, "input_s": 9.162, "n_real_chunks": 10, "score": 0.7095, "act": 0.9977, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The sum of the odd numbers from 1 to 199 is the sum of the first 100 odd numbers: \\[ 1+3+5+\\cdots+199 = 100^2 = 10000 \\] Now find the remainder modulo 7: \\[ 10000 \\div 7 = 1428 \\text{ remainder } 4 \\] Final answer: \\(\\boxed{4}\\)", "expert_answer": "The sum of the odd numbers from 1 to 199 is the sum of the first 100 odd numbers:\n\n\\[\n1+3+5+\\cdots+199 = 100^2 = 10000\n\\]\n\nNow find the remainder modulo 7:\n\n\\[\n10000 \\div 7 = 1428 \\text{ remainder } 4\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: \\(\\boxed{4}\\)**", "transcript": "Find the modulo seven dollars remainder of the sum one plus three plus five plus seven plus nine plus dots plus one ninety-five plus one ninety-seven plus one ninety-nine. Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 1.99, "expert_s": 6.0, "expert_input_samples": 146600, "expert_input_s": 9.162, "expert_input_sha256": "777b2daabeec03c9bc1ff2e86551ca302bdd003f8b670f9976fc6392b1497e33", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.985, "relay_synth_ms": 20481, "onset_chunk": 9, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 74, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 74, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttf