{"id": "q0250", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3582825827, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "According to Parfit, both Taurek and Lewis assume that for there to be a “sum of pain,” it must be:\n\nA. all be avoidable.\nB. only felt by multiple people at different times.\nC. all be experienced in the same way.\nD. all be of the same intensity.\nE. all felt by a single person.\nF. all be caused by a single source.\nG. all be caused by multiple sources.\nH. all be caused by a single event.\nI. all felt at a single time.\nJ. all of the above.\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0250.wav", "input_sha256": "a3a9bca1c3aa7d18a9ef2e209ad5ed4dcab9647d668a14e15d5865e325b9e6c3", "input_samples": 476000, "input_s": 29.75, "n_real_chunks": 30, "score": 0.7597, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "E, all felt by a single person.", "expert_answer": "**E, all felt by a single person.**", "transcript": "According to Parfit, both Torek and Lewis assume that for there to be a sum of pain, it must be A, all be avoidable, B, only felt by multiple people at different times, C, all be experienced in the same way, D, all be of the same intensity, E, all felt by a single person, F, all be caused by a singl", "asr_s": 2.1, "expert_s": 5.23, "expert_input_samples": 476000, "expert_input_s": 29.75, "expert_input_sha256": "a3a9bca1c3aa7d18a9ef2e209ad5ed4dcab9647d668a14e15d5865e325b9e6c3", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 6.417, "relay_synth_ms": 1461, "onset_chunk": 30, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 263, "f