{"id": "q0437", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 423549940, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "What is the GE Dash 8-32BWH", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0437.wav", "input_sha256": "2dc2a840be5f0352a563cb1c42b5bd13d8f51dc774faad4c7fdec25a045c5a57", "input_samples": 34600, "input_s": 2.163, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.9041, "act": 0.9973, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The GE-832BH appears to refer to registration 832 BH, associated with a 1959 Lister “Knobbly” Jaguar sports-racing car, chassis BHL103. It was a British racing car entry listed with: Make/model: Lister Knobbly Jaguar , Chassis: BHL103 , Registration: 832 BH , Year: 1959 , Engine: Jaguar XK inline-six , Noted owner/entrant: Derek Wilkinson / John Bekaert, reportedly ex–Peter Whitehead Sources list it in period racing records, including a 1959 Goodwood entry. (racingsportscars.com)", "expert_answer": "The **GE-832BH** appears to refer to **registration 832 BH**, associated with a **1959 Lister “Knobbly” Jaguar sports-racing car**, chassis **BHL103**.\n\nIt was a British racing car entry listed with:\n- **Make/model:** Lister Knobbly Jaguar  \n- **Chassis:** BHL103  \n- **Registration:** 832 BH  \n- **Year:** 1959  \n- **Engine:** Jaguar XK inline-six  \n- **Noted owner/entrant:** Derek Wilkinson / John Bekaert, reportedly ex–Peter Whitehead  \n\nSources list it in period racing records, including a 1959 Goodwood entry. ([racingsportscars.com](https://www.racingsportscars.com/entry/data/Goodwood-1959-03-30.html?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What is the GE-832BH?\n", "asr_s": 0.57, "expert_s": 7.7, "ex