{"id": "q0479", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2599039991, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "为一篇关于人工智能对经济潜在影响的文章创建一个引人注目的标题。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0479.wav", "input_sha256": "4b7651cf4ee332014b6a75422e240ccdb62a9ecca38ecff7c6340930e9782cea", "input_samples": 106000, "input_s": 6.625, "n_real_chunks": 7, "score": 0.2579, "act": 0.9989, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，那我来想想。如果要写一篇关于人工智能对经济潜在影响的文章，标题得吸引人且具象化。嗯，这个话题挺热门的，得有冲击力才行。比如可以用一些强烈的动词或形容词，让读者一看就想点进去。我想了下，可以用“变革”、“重塑”之类的词。嗯，或者说人工智能会颠覆什么？比如工作、行业，甚至整个经济结构。这样听起来更有分量。试试看这个：“智能风暴：人工智能将如何重塑全球经济”。怎么样？", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 6, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 36, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0479_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "cbe53f0961aa3071b1fa1efbfa8b7a8e319e31ad10124d0f639fc005e423a65b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 36.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.106, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.067, 2.118, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.067, 3.118, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.068, 4.122, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.062, 5.11, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.068, 6.123, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 6.625, 6.695, 7.2, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.625, 7.696, 8.307, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.625, 8.694, 9.299, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.625, 9.692, 10.275, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.625, 10.696, 11.341, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.625, 11.697, 12.34, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.625,