{"id": "q0493", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3837589351, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "c1188d4ab398808355719c420f025bd920b27aba798f5596eb328457a751cc63", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "设计国际妇女节活动海报。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0493.wav", "input_sha256": "5cab842fcf0eccba7017b655bcbfa43388c0f3eaccf81625ccbb3ea496bce742", "input_samples": 40600, "input_s": 2.538, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.545, "act": 0.9901, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "好的，没问题。如果你需要设计一张国际妇女节的活动海报，我建议你从几个关键元素开始。首先颜色上可以用粉色、紫色和白色，这些颜色传达出女性力量和庆祝的氛围。然后画面可以放一些女性形象，比如不同年龄、职业和背景的女性，展示她们的力量与多样性。可以加上三月八日的日期和活动主题，比如“共建更平等的未来”之类的标语。再加上活动时间地点以及主办方信息。字体要清晰易读，标题可以稍微大一些，突出重点。如果你用图像编辑软件比如Canva或者Pinterest找素材，会很方便。记得整体风格要积极向上，充满希望感。这样一张海报就差不多了，希望对你有帮助！", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 56, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0493_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "72528bc60e51a97e9d7a356b2c4e441502091bb3f1ceb6c495b0550dd4064cb0", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 56.04}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.065, 1.117, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.068, 2.123, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.538, 2.607, 2.662, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.538, 3.598, 4.003, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.537, 4.606, 5.146, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.537, 5.604, 6.189, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.537, 6.598, 7.174, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.537, 7.609, 8.182, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.537, 8.6, 9.166, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.537, 9.598, 10.162, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.537, 10.6, 1